      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im writing this. it just feels like i’m existing in this weird, gray limbo. every day is exactly the same... the meds, the cleaning, the watching her fade a little more. it’s like i'm already dead, just waiting for my body to catch up to how empty i feel inside. i'm just so tired. not even the kind of tired sleep fixes. just... done.",
